    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f11a7c64f0520a85e260ee3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跑出“最棒比赛”的表现后，\n胜利奖券获得优胜，\n呼唤“奖券藏”，赞颂她获胜的声音响彻赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1e86e5768297bd2dd7aba19d796ca495dad3a1f62f038c02d7cd6fb0ae90db3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f562a70745d7e1a21e580858",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成功让粉丝看到梦想令她心满意足，\n并发誓在“菊花赏”\n也要跑出同样热血的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f548d6e4e1c9ea792400655a7b253576337615d613859d13d382b199087d409f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8e8da2ba136a4599942b5d1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田大进与琵琶晨光两人，\n虽然祝贺胜利奖券取得优胜，\n但也宣告下次一定不会输。",
      "source_fingerprint": "162aa47b1e018cb2c73f512ed33ce60177c01255f5fa9cb0ad34ecff032fb445",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2a79ebd0e44a1ab03383b60",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“能在今天的比赛获胜，都要感谢她们。”\n感动不已的胜利奖券嚎啕大哭。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69ee2260b772e71131d6d4bf5e77b615ade36352324ab9fc89c0ee385a072122",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c02e9bd94602a9e153698137",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "日本德比结束后・跑到终点完全胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89b7a5db36c1c7c1342a471eac0e94d2a73a10296137cc633a507f1f48c06989",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2754f9b751ed46111d48927",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "胜利奖券用尽全力奔跑，\n却仍无法在“日本德比”获胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b76ad68e512f87a4ace5c1def8201aeb1f9ac02d546ff6a4bf305a6a35ef9e00",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efea9892678c0cbddd2ba1ca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无法达成梦想的不甘，\n让胜利奖券泣不成声。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeba3ac4b65b4c2932af18fc9c5656448584dec74c876cad145ca6c50a90711a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5ab75529b119d957378095e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "等她冷静下来，想到虽然输了，\n但应该有将“最棒的比赛”\n献给粉丝后，便恢复了精神。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e521241ebad902d36bd8af6b5c4911a5e63149e9217e8bb0bf2842f1bdc7551a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a399746d9a97f7563a71ba7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接着她表示在下场赛事“菊花赏”\n也要跑出最棒的比赛，并露出了笑容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c11bf864bdf577a4a17024e6cef8b51e5d181cad9313f57cdb1b3acf0bb2616",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70e3949f746285176371e6d4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "日本德比结束后・跑到终点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c3048c4afa79e8357306d1ca4d38bf1e44d9d33a9e9dac1ea6efcd129f5b083",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:615556d4442b5c407e153d7d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“BNW”的对决使这场比赛的气氛火热，\n最后，由胜利奖券夺下胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1189b52b03518f7361b903062a4acf26258189d6f4c8cdc2c4722bee470b1548",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e45bfdd5462d95dbee75a31e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“想再次跟她们一起跑出最棒的比赛。”\n抱着这样的想法，她将下个目标定为\n她们也很有可能参赛的大阪杯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c452a3b0416bea47626e0c688e7ae9e8be91819774c7be8809590360bbfd0809",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e827b167a28c59f1a71edfea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但成田大进与琵琶晨光却以冷静的视线\n注视着这样的胜利奖券。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a8879281b84291b692982595febc35b31af7cd675ad0acfaada73ba05d51517",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f069dc841b7f6b56d94de72",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菊花赏结束后・最棒的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "39810904a26541ccec2dcb0d87d567b186e1bd9b135d4e51f806737a12c9fc16",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29283f67d49bf526e906d08f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“BNW”的对决使这场比赛的气氛火热，\n最后胜利奖券并未夺下优胜，但是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7f439796ccb6bee54245bd0def1922ef3197add2e5402f2d0c222fd109c0ee8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbc102fce895c5a72f4a0372",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“想再次跟她们一起跑出最棒的比赛。”\n抱着这样的想法，她将下个目标定为\n她们也很有可能参赛的大阪杯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c452a3b0416bea47626e0c688e7ae9e8be91819774c7be8809590360bbfd0809",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
