      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“宝冢纪念”时与琵琶晨光间的对决，\n最后由胜利奖券取得胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7b1fececce284564265dd51a8560db56316d2688ad7a1667fda80baa93a95ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
