    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fe0bb127217c15c978401a2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛过后。胜利奖券向琵琶晨光说：\n“往后也以对手身份，\n一起跑出最棒的比赛吧。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c58def8f10737deeae427d79dfb8a66babe9687f4786981113c023bec893bbe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
