      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但琵琶晨光却回答她，\n现在与“日本德比”时不同，\n她已经不把胜利奖券当成竞争对手了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff1069df3eee787d50390b495e8e6ecc3401deef27e79884b0b00a3645f43ce7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035429.json",
      "json_path": [
